flowchart LR
    U[BA / PM / Stakeholder] --> FE[React web application]
    FE --> BE[External .NET backend]
    BE --> AUTH[Auth and project ownership]
    BE --> FILES[Backend-owned file storage]
    BE --> MEET[Meetings and recordings]
    BE --> AI[FastAPI internal AI API]
    AI --> DB[(PostgreSQL durable job state)]
    AI --> Q[Redis / RQ]
    Q --> W[AI worker]
    W --> G[15-node LangGraph pipeline]
    G --> CHAT[Chat LLM providers]
    G --> STT[Groq / Deepgram STT]
    G --> EMB[OpenAI-compatible embeddings]
    G --> ART[(PostgreSQL / pgvector artifacts)]
    W -. optional best-effort callback .-> BE
    FE -. explicit emergency fallback .-> AI
    MOBILE[Future mobile client] -. planned / unpublished .-> BE
